        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>函数交点问题解答</title>\n<script>\nwindow.MathJax = {\n  tex: {\n    inlineMath: [['$', '$']],\n    displayMath: [['$$', '$$']]\n  }\n};\n</script>\n<script id=\"MathJax-script\" async src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n<style>\n  body {\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 20px 30px;\n    background: #ffffff;\n    font-family: \"SimSun\", \"Songti SC\", serif;\n    color: #7a2020;\n    font-size: 15px;\n    line-height: 1.9;\n  }\n  .page {\n    position: relative;\n    width: 560px;\n    min-height: 460px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n  }\n  .header-right {\n    text-align: right;\n    color: #999;\n    font-size: 12px;\n    height: 14px;\n  }\n  .content {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: flex-start;\n  }\n  .left-col {\n    width: 275px;\n    padding-right: 5px;\n  }\n  .right-col {\n    width: 270px;\n    padding-top: 100px;\n  }\n  .center-line {\n    text-align: center;\n  }\n  .indent-line {\n    padding-left: 90px;\n  }\n  .placeholder {\n    width: 258px;\n    height: 190px;\n    border: 1px dashed #bbbbbb;\n    color: #888888;\n    font-size: 12px;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    text-align: center;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n  }\n  p {\n    margin: 0 0 4px 0;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"page\">\n  <div class=\"header-right\">[illegible]</div>\n\n  <div class=\"content\">\n    <div class=\"left-col\">\n      <p>令 $F(a)=\\ln a-\\dfrac{a-1}{a+1}$, $F(1)=0$</p>\n      <p class=\"indent-line\">$F'(a)=\\dfrac{1}{a}-\\dfrac{2}{(a+1)^2}=\\dfrac{a^2+1}{a(a+1)^2}&gt;0$</p>\n      <p>$\\therefore F(a)$ 在 $(0,+\\infty)$ 上递增, $a=1$</p>\n      <p>（2）先画图分析:</p>\n      <p>由（1）知, $f(x)$ 在 $(-\\infty,0)\\searrow$, $(0,+\\infty)\\nearrow$;</p>\n      <p>$g(x)$ 在 $(0,1)\\searrow$, $(1,+\\infty)\\nearrow$</p>\n      <p>要有三个交点则必是如右所示, 考场中可用零点存在定理说明一下, 两函数在 $(0,1)$ 上有一个交点 $x_0$。</p>\n      <p>由题知:</p>\n      <p>$g(x_1)=g(x_0)=f(x_0)=f(x_2)$</p>\n      <p>$e^{x_1}-x_1=e^{x_0}=x_0-\\ln x_0=x_2-\\ln x_2\\cdots$*</p>\n      <p>$x_1&lt;0$, $0&lt;x_0&lt;1$, $x_2&gt;1$</p>\n      <p>$e^{x_1}-x_1=e^{\\ln x_0}-\\ln x_0$, $x_2-\\ln x_2=e^{e^{x_0}}-\\ln e^{x_0}$, $e^{x_0}&gt;1$</p>\n      <p>即 $g(x_1)=g(\\ln x_0)$, $x_1,\\ln x_0&lt;0\\Rightarrow x_1=\\ln x_0$; 同理 $f(x_2)=f(e^{x_0})\\Rightarrow x_2=e^{x_0}$</p>\n      <p>$x_1+x_2=\\ln x_0+e^{x_0}=2x_0$ 由 (*) 式可得。</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"right-col\">\n      <figure class=\"placeholder\" style=\"margin:0;\">\n        [Diagram: right side — coordinate axes with $y$ and $x$, an upward exponential-type curve and a U-shaped curve intersecting; horizontal line labeled $y=b$; dashed vertical lines to points labeled $x_1$, $x_0$, $x_2$ on the $x$-axis]\n      </figure>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
